  "testId": "testClasses.webstore.quickOrder.QuickOrderWithMultipleSkuTest#multipleSkuVerifyQuickOrderPadPageFunctionality",
  "scenario": {
    "summary": "On the Quick Order Pad selects a product from the auto-suggestion (default quantity 1), adds and removes a second row with the same product, sets quantity 3, adds to cart and checks the cart count and the cart line name, price, quantity and total; then empties the cart.",
    "steps": [
      "Open the webstore, Quick Order, Add Multiple Items",
      "Select value0 SKU from the auto-suggestion; verify quantity = 1",
      "Add Row; type the SKU in the new row, select the suggestion; verify quantity = 1; remove the row",
      "Set quantity value2 SKUQuantity (3); Add to Cart",
      "Verify cart heading; cart icon count = 3",
      "Verify cart line name, price, quantity and total",
      "Remove all items"
    ],
    "entitiesTouched": [
      "store",
      "product",
      "cart"
    ],
    "stateChanges": [
      "Guest cart: product x3 added, then removed"
    ],
    "assertions": [
      "Quantity fields = 1 after selection",
      "Cart icon count = 3",
      "Line name = product name",
      "Line price = product price",
      "Line quantity = 3",
      "Line total = price x 3"
    ],
    "evidence": [
      "Independent method (priority 10, no dependsOn): opens the webstore itself and empties the cart at the end.",
      "value0 SKU z-1234576 (quickOrderPage!B3): SimpleProduct 'Frigidaire 5,000 BTU Window-Mounted Air Conditioner', DisablePurchasing, Min 1 / Max 100 (tda rows). The asserted name and price come from row value2 (D5/E5), which holds the same product: one need product = PRODUCT_SIMPLE_IN_STOCK {quantityUsed 3, minMaxQuantity 3, maxPersonalizableAttributes 0, store}, preferred value0 SKU (not required).",
      "Outputs: sku, name, salesPrice, else retailPrice ('$165.00'). Line total '$495.00' is expected-output (price x 3, computed by the migrated test).",
      "value0 SKUQuantity 1, value2 SKUQuantity 3 and value2 Quantity 3 are config. REVIEW: the default quantity 1 may be the product's MinimumQuantity (see the single-SKU entry).",
      "Store: openWebstoreUrl opens automation_webStoreUrl (atstage: webstore-z10-atstage, the main store MaxwellsHardware), the same store as the Selenium shoppingCart entries and the Playwright quick-order entries.",
      "Profile: work/profiles/profile.json (2026-11-01) was not run for these Selenium tests (profiled false); product facts come from bin/tda rows dbo.ZnodePimProduct (2026-11-05) and the approved Playwright quick-order entries.",
      "Scanned constant values (locators, report messages, delays) are framework constants: role config, no need.",
      "migrate: Selenium reads Excel tables through TestData.getMap; there is no swap for Selenium."
    ],
    "confidence": "medium",
    "needsReview": true
  },
  "requires": [
    {
      "key": "PRODUCT_SIMPLE_IN_STOCK",
      "alias": "product",
      "params": {
        "maxPersonalizableAttributes": 0,
        "quantityUsed": 3,
        "store": "MaxwellsHardware",
        "minMaxQuantity": 3
      },
      "preferred": {
        "source": 6,
        "required": false
      }
    }
  ],
